{"id":"343763670aeca8e0","group":"93","path":"93/93-prop-equational-class.md","title":"Equational Class","display":"Equational Class","type":"proposition","metadata":{"type":"proposition","book":"Algebraizable Logics","book_abbrev":"93","label":"93-prop-equational-class","aliases":["93-prop-equational-class"],"display":"Equational Class","authors":"W. J. Blok, Don Pigozzi","book_title":"Algebraizable Logics","depends_on":["[[93-df-equation]]","[[93-df-equational-class]]","[[93-df-variety]]","[[93-df-closure-operators]]","[[93-df-similarity-type]]","[[93-df-algebra]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"proposition"},{"key":"book","html":"Algebraizable Logics"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"93"},{"key":"label","html":"93-prop-equational-class"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>93-prop-equational-class</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"Equational Class"},{"key":"authors","html":"W. J. Blok, Don Pigozzi"},{"key":"book_title","html":"Algebraizable Logics"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"1e2cbe43bd24f67f\" href=\"?note=1e2cbe43bd24f67f\" title=\"93-df-equation\">93-df-equation</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"55094a403a51c25e\" href=\"?note=55094a403a51c25e\" title=\"93-df-equational-class\">93-df-equational-class</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"f0b0edbaa6696a1d\" href=\"?note=f0b0edbaa6696a1d\" title=\"93-df-variety\">93-df-variety</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"97b46a497e251f9f\" href=\"?note=97b46a497e251f9f\" title=\"93-df-closure-operators\">93-df-closure-operators</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"ee84ed8b0fae5bc3\" href=\"?note=ee84ed8b0fae5bc3\" title=\"93-df-similarity-type\">93-df-similarity-type</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"6730349967b8ffce\" href=\"?note=6730349967b8ffce\" title=\"93-df-algebra\">93-df-algebra</a></span></div>"}],"html":"<h1 id=\"prop-equational-class-—-Equational-Class\">prop-equational-class — Equational Class</h1>\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{SimType}_{93}(\\tau)\">\\(\\mathrm{SimType}_{93}(\\tau)\\)</span>, and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal V\\subseteq\\{\\mathbf A:\\mathrm{Alg}_{\\tau}(\\mathbf A)\\}\">\\(\\mathcal V\\subseteq\\{\\mathbf A:\\mathrm{Alg}_{\\tau}(\\mathbf A)\\}\\)</span> is a class of algebras of that type.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm H_{\\tau}\">\\(\\mathrm H_{\\tau}\\)</span>, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm S_{\\tau}\">\\(\\mathrm S_{\\tau}\\)</span>, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm P_{\\tau}\">\\(\\mathrm P_{\\tau}\\)</span> are the closure operators of <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"97b46a497e251f9f\" href=\"?note=97b46a497e251f9f\" title=\"93-df-closure-operators\">93-df-closure-operators</a>.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{EqClass}_{93}\">\\(\\mathrm{EqClass}_{93}\\)</span> is the equational-class predicate of <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"55094a403a51c25e\" href=\"?note=55094a403a51c25e\" title=\"93-df-equational-class\">93-df-equational-class</a>.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{SimType}_{93}\">\\(\\mathrm{SimType}_{93}\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Alg}_{\\tau}\">\\(\\mathrm{Alg}_{\\tau}\\)</span> are the predicates of <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-9\" data-note=\"ee84ed8b0fae5bc3\" href=\"?note=ee84ed8b0fae5bc3\" title=\"93-df-similarity-type\">93-df-similarity-type</a> and <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-10\" data-note=\"6730349967b8ffce\" href=\"?note=6730349967b8ffce\" title=\"93-df-algebra\">93-df-algebra</a>.</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{prop\\text{-}equational\\text{-}class}\\vdash\n\\Bigl(\\mathrm{SimType}_{93}(\\tau)\\land\n\\mathcal V\\subseteq\\{\\mathbf A:\\mathrm{Alg}_{\\tau}(\\mathbf A)\\}\\Bigr)\\to\n\\Bigl(\\mathrm{EqClass}_{93}(\\mathcal V,\\tau)\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm H_{\\tau}(\\mathcal V)=\\mathcal V\\land\\mathrm S_{\\tau}(\\mathcal V)=\\mathcal V\\land\\mathrm P_{\\tau}(\\mathcal V)=\\mathcal V\\Bigr)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{prop\\text{-}equational\\text{-}class}\\vdash\n\\Bigl(\\mathrm{SimType}_{93}(\\tau)\\land\n\\mathcal V\\subseteq\\{\\mathbf A:\\mathrm{Alg}_{\\tau}(\\mathbf A)\\}\\Bigr)\\to\n\\Bigl(\\mathrm{EqClass}_{93}(\\mathcal V,\\tau)\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm H_{\\tau}(\\mathcal V)=\\mathcal V\\land\\mathrm S_{\\tau}(\\mathcal V)=\\mathcal V\\land\\mathrm P_{\\tau}(\\mathcal V)=\\mathcal V\\Bigr)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>Equational classes are precisely the varieties, characterized by HSP closure. Isomorphic-image closure alone cannot replace homomorphic-image closure.</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"prop-equational-class-—-Equational-Class","text":"prop-equational-class — Equational Class","level":1},{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"93-df-equation","status":"resolved","id":"1e2cbe43bd24f67f","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[93-df-equation]]","embed":false},{"target":"93-df-equational-class","status":"resolved","id":"55094a403a51c25e","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[93-df-equational-class]]","embed":false},{"target":"93-df-variety","status":"resolved","id":"f0b0edbaa6696a1d","anchor":